; Status line text
;
; The fixed words of the status line in the top character row (screen address $4000): "PASSES   SCORE       BEST" (25
; characters). Printed by #R$6000 with #R$6B4F when a maze is drawn during a real game; the number of passes (lives),
; the score and the best score are then drawn into the gaps by #R$6000 and #R$65C7 with #R$6B21.
; .
; Format: plain ASCII characters, terminated by $FF.
;
@label=StatusText
t$7C47 DEFM "PASSES   SCORE       BEST"
 $7C60 DEFB $FF
